</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<pardef id='10' keepwithnext='true' keeptogether='true'/>
<par def='10'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Exit: </run></par>
<pardef id='11' leftmargin='0.2604in' list='bullet' keepwithnext='true' keeptogether='true'/>
<par def='11'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Close the Order form.  If changes were made to the document, the system will prompt the user to save.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='32px' width='63px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhPwAgAOMAAMDAwNDQyAAAAICAgEBAQAD4+ACAgP///0hISAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
AAAAACwAAAAAPwAgAEAI/wAHCBxIsKDBgwgTJkSAMEAAABAjSoxowMDEixgzatTo0KFEAQYKADgQ
EoDIkyZTCvjIcqNLiR0fuhSwEgDNlzhzQoyps6dPlzwlVkyJEmXNn0gBBL0IUiRJkTQJHrXZ8mjN
lVeBdkzK9WfMr2DDih1LtmzYrmhzLr041Ghar1spjixZlChVpjSnol0LsenculBvfsyLEWtEw30x
8p3YVADBvnptEj48+S7kyDvjvt18cTHnzQ4JiB5NurTp06hTq0ZttrXr12U/y87scfZnz0JLYrY9
0XNFwJZ5d9YMwMBTu3V3215b8jhwqIxbpuXr1zlyk4KDD86aWPJuz9XpYjR3PEC51cmI82aHSZxx
86gDIR+uOr+7Zcy4DxsgL1947/YZVebfcLUN2FV+BqoF24IMthYQADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='7'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Save:</run><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> </run></par>
<par def='11'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The button save is used to save the order if the validation passes</run></par>
<par def='11'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>If the Financial Code has not been generated, the system will ask the user to click on "Generate Financial Code".</run></par>
<pardef id='12' leftmargin='0.2604in' list='bullet' tabs='L1in L1.5000in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'
 keepwithnext='true' keeptogether='true'/>
<par def='12'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will validate the mandatory fields.  The mandatory fields are identified with an apostrophe *.</run></par>
<par def='12'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will ensure there is a Card Holder if the Purchase Type is "Visa" or "Mastercard".</run></par>
<par def='12'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will ensure there is a Signing Authority if the Purchase Type is "Purchase Order".</run></par>
<par def='12'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will ensure there is a company name, a phone and a fax.</run></par>
<par def='12'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will display a warning popup if the Remaining Credit amount on the Credit Card or the Budget for the project is exceeded.  If such a warning is displayed, you can modify the quantities of ordered items, adjust the cost, choose a different purchase type.  The Admin can also adjust the Remaining Credit on the Credit Card or adjust the Budget for the project.  The warnings are reassessed each time the new and submitted orders are saved.  If the warning has not been dealt before the Admin clicks on [Got It], then emails may be sent to the Principal Investigator for the project, the Section Head for the project, the Credit Card holder, or the Admin.</run></par>
<par def='7'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The status of the order is set to "</run><run><font size='11pt'
 style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>New</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>"</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='33px' width='171px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhqwAhAOMAAMDAwNDQyAAAAICAgODg4EBAQAD4AAAA+AAAgACAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
