ByzwwAQXbPDBCCes8MIJC+nwwxBHvFxAADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='10'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Generate Financial Code:</run></par>
<par def='11'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Allows the user to select a Financial Code.</run></par>
<par def='11'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button is displayed only if the Project has been selected.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='30px' width='111px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhbwAeAOMAAMDAwNDQyAAAAEBAQP///4CAgAAAgAAA+ACAgPgAAPgA+AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
AAAAACwAAAAAbwAeAEAI/wAHCBxIsKDBgwgTKlzIsKFDgwECAJhIsWJFAQcsatzIsaPHjyBDeowY
