gz36yNJ83tUHJZRSTrlelVaOF1FAADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='10'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Mail To Admin:</run></par>
<pardef id='13' leftmargin='0.2604in' list='bullet' tabs='L1in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'
 keepwithnext='true' keeptogether='true'/>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Used by the creator of the Order to send and E-mail to inform the Administrator that the order has been created and is ready to action.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The status of the Order is changed to “</run><run><font size='11pt'
 style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Submitted</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>”.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Note</run><run><font size='11pt' style='bold'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>:</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> The receiver of the "Mail to Admin" email is defined using the "SendToAdmin" keyword.  That keyword is accessible only by administrators by clicking on the button "Admin" on the left navigator and by clicking on "Keywords".  Changes to the MailToAdmin keyword are reflected only after a few hours until the "Cache" is refreshed.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='31px' width='68px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhRAAfAOIAAMDAwNDQyAAAAICAgP///4AAAPgAAAAAACwAAAAARAAfAEAI/wADCBxIsKDB
gwgTKlxIEIBDhwMIPCRAseKAAgYMPNzIsaPHjyABFPQoAMAAkwJSmhzAckDJjS8BpHwZkyZHmzI9
jgR5sYDKkECDChXZcKjRo0h3Pox4sunMpyc/zkQa02HVh0o9unyaMqpUlTV/WoX5sORVh1mRql3L
MS3bt0mLcoxYkQBLhxg1wmWblulGuy3v7uUrF6JdkyifLu149WxZqWM7un3scmVLAV4fk80ZuXFn
nYU79hQ7+O3k0qjbMlzNurXr17Bju05N++PpwJlrxx0oWmJdiicz6tUNtK/Eib8LEB9qHDFErrmX
g+a9MSJilly7Qo68nTH3jW5LNkbdqjKw5680SZsFO10gZOzizec+X/M7Z5yqqUsdfzk695/1caaZ
Y1iFNtdo0hl1GkQIJijUgisV4JODDxpIoWmyZajhQQEBADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='10'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Got It:</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button is displayed only to the Administrators</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Allows the Administrators to generate a sequential reference number.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The status of the Order is changed to “</run><run><font size='11pt'
 style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>On Order</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>”.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>A confirmation email is sent to the person listed in the field “Ship To” field.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>(</run><run><font size='11pt' style='bold italic' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>NEW added to the August 2009 release</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>) The order's cost W/Applicable GST is automatically committed to the project and removed from the Remaining Credit on the Credit Card if a Credit Card is used as the purchase type.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>If the </run><run><font size='11pt' style='underline' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Monthly Limit of the Credit Card exceeds the cost of the order</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>, the application displays the warning message “WARNING!!!  You have exceeded the monthly credit card limit!!”and sends an email to the card holder and the Section Head of the project.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>If the </run><run><font size='11pt' style='underline' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Order’s cost is higher than 5000$</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> the application displays the warning message “WARNING!!!  You have exceeded the $5000 per order limit!!!” and sends an email to the card holder and the Section Head of the project.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>If the </run><run><font size='11pt' style='underline' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Remaining Credit amount of the Credit Card exceeds the cost of the order</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>, the application displays the warning message “WARNING!!!  The order total exceeds the available credit for this credit card.” and sends an email to the card holder and the Section Head of the project.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>If the </run><run><font size='11pt' style='underline' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>budget for Operation, Travel, Contract or Capital is exceeded</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>, the application displays the warning message “WARNING!!!  You have exceeded the Operating Budget Amount Limit !!!!” popup and sends an email to the Principal Investigator of the project and to the Section Head of the project.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>If the </run><run><font size='11pt' style='underline' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>total budget for the project is exceeded</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>, the application displays the warning message “WARNING!!!  You have exceeded the Total Budget Limit for the project!!!” and sends an email to the Principal Investigator of the project and to the Section Head of the project.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='30px' width='87px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhVwAeAOIAAMDAwNDQyAAAAICAgICAAACAAAAAgPj4ACwAAAAAVwAeAEAI/wADCBxIsKDB
gwgTKlzIcCGAhw8FEDBggIBFAgMyEhAAsaPHjyBDihxJEkDBjwJSFiiQceXKhys5dpQJUSZNmhE9
