gPcNuFOAHvVH3lhGZXfaXg7i1FtmBPKnG3bGOYfchRre5lqHsH0IImtwlWjiiQwFBAA7
</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='10'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>(</run><run><font size='11pt' style='bold italic'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>This button is removed from the August 2009 release, it is now part of the [Got it] button</run><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>) On Order:</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button is displayed only to the Administrators</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Allows the Administrators to </run><run><font size='11pt'
 style='underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>commit the cost of the order against the project’s budget</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>.  The budget is calculated only once per Order.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will also decrease the Remaining Credit amount of the Credit Card if the purchase was made with Visa or MasterCard.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The status of the Order is changed to “</run><run><font size='11pt'
 style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>On Order</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>”.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The view "View By Project" will display a green check mark beside the Orders for which the budget has been calculated.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='29px' width='92px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhXAAdAOIAAMDAwNDQyAAAAP///4CAgAAA+AAAgACAgCwAAAAAXAAdAEAI/wADCBxIsKDB
gwgTKlzIsKFAABAhEhgwkQCAiQMyUrwYsaPHjyBDihxJMmSAiAVSpjQAQOOAlgQICLAowKOAmzgj
1oS4cyeAmj57/tQ5lKdNokV9RjzZEWPLpy+jPlVasqrVqySZYt3KtWtXrRIzPp04U+pLqjhzejXK
