</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='10'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Receive All:</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button is displayed only to the Administrators</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Allows the Administrators to mark all items as received</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The status of the Order is changed to “</run><run><font size='11pt'
 style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Received</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>”.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='29px' width='60px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhPAAdAOIAAMDAwNDQyAAAAACAgP///4CAgAD4+AAAACwAAAAAPAAdAEAI/wADCBxIsKDB
gwgTKiwIoKHDhgUIACgAgEBEAQ8zatzIsSOAgQ8HGBhAsqTJkxgfpsy4MmXLhisfgvRIs6ZNjzNv
6tyJU6BGkhEhTqwogOTGmACQelT60adKAwUGRJ0qtWoBpjxrLtzKtSvXrGDD5sxYoKxZimHTjn0Y
FK1DrGl7Bsh4su5JjUgx6k0KM6lLAUrHirRLOO/Rt30TM10bt/FGxo4jN4Qs2THlynEvYxbrVGNE
AqAtwt3skPLn0FcBk+5oOrRrAnABy1Y6+nFnhyJPvxZggKnhm4tvD2gosXjF48bzzv6r2GXijIJH
Sh9s0sDIAb9ZIuar2PZc3MvDhxzXjnf7y+elb08UL97t6snq33P+Lj9z/Po8BwYEADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<pardef id='14' keepwithnext='true' keeptogether='true'/>
<par def='14'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Print:</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button is displayed to all users as long as the Reference Number has been populated.  Note that the Reference Number is generated when the Administrators click on the “Got it” button.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button opens a printable version of the Order form.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>When the Administrator uses the Print button, the Order is flagged as “</run><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Printed</run><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>” and a "printer like" icon </run><picture
 height='17px' width='23px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhFwARAOIAAP///4CAgMDAwAAAAAAA+ACAgAD4APgA+CwAAAAAFwARAEAIXwABCBxIsKDB
gwACCBgQoKHDhgMQSpxI8WEAigMVLhTAseNCjCAlamSYsSFGhQwFEChAQICBjyFjypxJ0+RFgSZP
ciRJ8OZElBo9whS5UwDLAgIODBWJcoDTpwJoTgwIADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> is displayed in the "View by Date"  view.  Note that this "</run><run
><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Printed</run><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>" flag is not set if the user is not administrator.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The Status of the order does not change.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='28px' width='98px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhYgAcAOIAAMDAwNDQyAAAAICAgACAAAD4AP///wAAACwAAAAAYgAcAEAI/wADCBxIsKDB
gwgTKlzIsOFCABAjSpxIsaLFixgzatwYkWBFAQUIADBAIKQAAAIGWBTAsmXEkxBhwkRJM2ZMmTZt
4qxZc+ZMiR45Ch1KtOjGoEaTKl2KEalElQZGSiVp8mNLlkw37sz4s+PAiioFEDg5AKrKlRN9Yn25
FmVbn2x3qv15taLTrHjzCr2rt6/fiXw1lhT5t3DGwAQIRF08mOxZiV27GuaJUTKAwANAFqha9jHF
yDkhp30ZemtO06XtfsVYdrJrjoFfyx7qsLbt27hzr57Nm2js3sBVCwxO/PDuoYmL/8XcubnKxsr9
xl48FXpr0dhlW/4sPADFkiEZm07s/HH0Tbpv37qFvHary7iWYw+2vp3y3Pbme5KmrN/te7gUYQaA
dSp5lt9p+8EF4IKkyZXgfoAdF1FnBGSWEnnRLSdhhsX9xiFvHn4oW0AAOw==
</gif></picture><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></tablecell>
<tablecell>
<par def='7'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Reconciled:</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button is displayed only to the Administrators</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Allows the Administrators to mark the Order as reconciled.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>(</run><run><font size='11pt' style='bold italic' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>NEW added to the August 2009 release</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>) The order's cost is added back to the Remaining Credit of the Credit Card if MasterCard of VISA was used as the purchase type</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The status of the Order is changed to “</run><run><font size='11pt'
 style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Reconciled</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>”.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>(</run><run><font size='11pt' style='bold italic' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>NEW added to the August 2009 release</run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>) </run><run
><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Reconciled orders cannot be cancelled to prevent unexpected results.  If a reconciled order has to be cancelled, the administrator has to change the order's cost to zero and click on "Save".  The committed amount to the Project will be removed.</run></par>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Note</run><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>: the Green checkmark in the “View by Project” indicates the Order for which the budget has been committed to the project's budget and Credit Card.  If the budget has not been calculated, a red X is displayed.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
<tablecell>
<par def='6'><picture height='30px' width='109px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhbQAeAOIAAMDAwNDQyAAAAPgAAIAAAICAgAAAAAAAACwAAAAAbQAeAEAI/wADCBxIsKDB
gwgTKlzIsKHDgwAiSoxIYKLFihYzatzIsaPHjyAlFuxIYIBJkxg3CvC4EoCAljAlrmzpMiJNmxZh
